{
  "id": "2b73e237-d359-4d08-9d58-362a8b696658",
  "title": "3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. FlowPainter introduces a diffusion-based optical flow framework that reformulates dense-flow generation as confidence-guided soft inpainting, achieving strong accuracy and efficiency by integrating reliable discriminative priors with diffusion refinement. These advancements address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging.",
  "facts": [
